  "description": "<p data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"460\">Beleef een van de meest geliefde Pokémon-avonturen met <strong data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"255\">Pokémon SoulSilver Version</strong> voor de <strong data-start=\"264\" data-end=\"279\">Nintendo DS</strong>. Reis door de <strong data-start=\"294\" data-end=\"309\">Johto-regio</strong>, vang klassieke Pokémon en neem het op tegen acht Gym Leaders in deze uitgebreide en sfeervolle RPG. Een absolute favoriet onder fans en verzamelaars!</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"480\">⭐ Over de game</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<li data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"524\">\r\n<p data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"524\">🗺️ <strong data-start=\"487\" data-end=\"522\">Verken de Johto- én Kanto-regio</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"525\" data-end=\"580\">\r\n<p data-start=\"527\" data-end=\"580\">🐾 <strong data-start=\"530\" data-end=\"558\">Pokémon lopen met je mee</strong> – uniek en iconisch</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"624\">\r\n<p data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"624\">🤝 <strong data-start=\"586\" data-end=\"603\">Ruil & battle</strong> met andere spelers</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"625\" data-end=\"669\">\r\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"669\">📖 <strong data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"667\">Uitgebreid en nostalgisch verhaal</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"704\">\r\n<p data-start=\"672\" data-end=\"704\">🎯 Geschikt voor <strong data-start=\"689\" data-end=\"704\">jong en oud</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"706\" data-end=\"726\">💾 Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<li data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"759\">\r\n<p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"759\">🎮 <strong data-start=\"732\" data-end=\"745\">Platform:</strong> Nintendo DS</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"782\">\r\n<p data-start=\"762\" data-end=\"782\">🕹️ <strong data-start=\"766\" data-end=\"776\">Genre:</strong> RPG</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"783\" data-end=\"806\">\r\n<p data-start=\"785\" data-end=\"806\">🌍 <strong data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"797\">Taal:</strong> Engels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"807\" data-end=\"849\">\r\n<p data-start=\"809\" data-end=\"849\">💽 <strong data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"823\">Medium:</strong> Originele gamecartridge</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"851\" data-end=\"866\">📦 Levering</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<li data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"901\">\r\n<p data-start=\"869\" data-end=\"901\">✔️ <strong data-start=\"872\" data-end=\"899\">Alleen de gamecartridge</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"902\" data-end=\"955\">\r\n<p data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"955\">❌ Geen doos, handleiding of Pokéwalker inbegrepen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"957\" data-end=\"969\">🔍 Staat</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<li data-start=\"970\" data-end=\"1004\">\r\n<p data-start=\"972\" data-end=\"1004\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1002\">Goede tweedehands staat</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1005\" data-end=\"1038\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1007\" data-end=\"1038\">✔️ Getest en volledig werkend</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1040\" data-end=\"1189\">✨ Een <strong data-start=\"1046\" data-end=\"1088\">zeldzame en zeer gewilde Pokémon-titel</strong>, ideaal voor spelers die hun collectie compleet willen maken of het avontuur opnieuw willen beleven.</p>",
